;; A nine-wide pool whose far bank stands one tile above the water. Found by
;; the A1 review: the first build reported it unreachable (the search tried
;; one candidate path per target and that path would not realize), while
;; the physics crosses it: holding right and pressing jump every p ticks
;; landed on the bank in 19 of 22 policies (the reviewer's test-pool).
(fixture
  name: "a pool, the far bank one tile up"
  expect: reachable
  why: "the A1 review's direct physics runs: 19 of 22 swim-and-leap policies land"
  start: (3 6)
  target: ((20 5))
  grid:
  ("#########################"
   "#                       #"
   "#                       #"
   "#                       #"
   "#                       #"
   "#                       #"
   "#                ########"
   "########~~~~~~~~~########"
   "########~~~~~~~~~########"
   "########~~~~~~~~~########"
   "#########################"))
